      "updated": 1752078782097,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Adapting LLMs:\n    - Finetuning\n        - PEFT, Adapters, LoRA, etc.\n    - Prompt engineering\n        - Chain of thought prompting\n    - RAGs\n\nRAG\n    - Retrieval\n        - Document parsing\n        - Document chunking\n        - Indexing\n        - Nearest neighbor and ANN\n            - Clustering\n            - tree-based\n            - LSH\n    - Generation\n        - LLM + prompt engineering\n    - System Design\n\nProject 2: A customer-support chatbot",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Adapting LLMs:\n    - Finetuning\n        - PEFT, Adapters, LoRA, etc.\n    - Prompt engineering\n        - Chain of thought prompting\n    - RAGs\n\nRAG\n    - Retrieval\n        - Document parsing\n        - Document chunking\n        - Indexing\n        - Nearest neighbor and ANN\n            - Clustering\n            - tree-based\n            - LSH\n    - Generation\n        - LLM + prompt engineering\n    - System Design\n\nProject 2: A customer-support chatbot",
      "autoResize": true,
